      "first": {
        "speaker": 11,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "Ninety-eight. Furrowing of Forehead. Furrowing of the forehead is a good indicator that something is amiss or the person is insecure. It is also seen when people are concentrating or trying to make sense of something."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 11,
        "line": 1135,
        "text": "Number one hundred twenty: Relaxed and Squared. Shoulders that are suddenly relaxed and squared are saying, “I am confident.” If someone goes from slumped shoulders to squared relaxed shoulders I would be concerned as they are likely to be strong."
      }
